    old "A Bear Guard has been hearing strange noises in the Chilly Ice Cave, he asked me to investigate the source of the echoes."
    new "一名熊卫兵一直在寒冰洞窟听到奇怪的声响，他请我调查回声的来源。"

    old "A Forest mostly shrouded by the dense area of trees."
    new "一片大多被茂密树林遮蔽的森林。"

    old "A Green Dye that is made of natural leaves from somewhere far away."
    new "一种用远方某处的天然树叶制成的绿色染料。"

    old "A Journal that contains the last few entries of the Mayor's discovery in the longhouse."
    new "一本记载着市长在长屋中发现的最后几篇记录的日志。"

    old "A Lion Charm made by Sebas."
    new "一枚塞巴斯制作的狮子护符。"

    old "A Necklace with a slime crystal imbedded into the golden frame."
    new "一条金色框架中嵌有史莱姆水晶的项链。"

    old "A Normal Trousers worn by a Hunter, with a surprisingly stretchy fly piece..."
    new "猎人穿过的普通长裤，前襟部分意外地富有弹性……"

    old "A Rolling Stone"
    new "一块滚石"

    old "A Trinket that creates 5 thorns that retaliate every time you are attacked. Damage based on the amount of thorns."
    new "一件能制造5根荆棘的饰品，每次你受到攻击时都会进行反击。伤害取决于荆棘的数量。"

    old "A Trinket that enhances your critical damage, but decreases your dodge chance every time you've critically striked."
    new "一件能提高暴击伤害的饰品，但每次你打出暴击时，闪避率都会降低。"

    old "A Trinket that enhances your damaging spells to apply 3 wounds to target enemies."
    new "一件能强化伤害性法术、使其对目标敌人施加3层创伤的饰品。"

    old "A Trinket that enhances your spells to apply 3 wounds to target enemies."
    new "一件能强化法术、使其对目标敌人施加3层创伤的饰品。"

    old "A Trinket that heals and enhances your maximum health by every turn, but your initial health are lowered."
    new "一件每回合都会治疗你并提高最大生命值的饰品，但会降低你的初始生命值。"

    old "A Trinket that heals you each time an enemy has taken damage, but decreases the effectiveness of your defense."
    new "一件每当敌人受到伤害时就会治疗你的饰品，但会降低防御效果。"

    old "A Trinket with luck effect, it will increase your chance for loot drop, but decrease luck during battle."
    new "一件带有幸运效果的饰品，会提高战利品掉落率，但会降低战斗中的幸运。"

    old "A barbed spear that sticks in the target when penetrated, it's extremely difficult to pull out without causing extreme damage. The harpoon was mainly used for hunting creatures in the water, but as the tribe moved inland, it is now seldom used as a weapon."
    new "一柄带倒刺的长矛，刺入目标后会牢牢卡住；若不造成极大的伤害，便极难拔出。鱼叉原本主要用于猎捕水中生物，但随着部落迁往内陆，如今已很少再被当作武器使用。"

    old "A bright tunic woven by a renowned tailor, the intricate patterns and soft fabric make it a popular choice for those who want to look good while adventuring."
    new "一件由知名裁缝织成的鲜艳外衣，繁复的纹样与柔软的布料让它成为冒险时想保持体面者的热门选择。"

    old "A bundle of fur fell from a feral fellow. Its softness is useful to withstand extreme situations of various terrains."
    new "一捆从野蛮家伙身上掉落的毛皮。它的柔软质地有助于应对各种地形中的极端环境。"

    old "A button from the scarecrow that can be used for any fastener on the clothes..."
    new "一枚来自稻草人的纽扣，可以用作衣物上的任何扣件……"

    old "A carrot buried in the Dark Forest, should be a very alluring food for a certain creature..."
    new "一根埋在黑暗森林中的胡萝卜，对某种生物来说应该是极具诱惑力的食物……"

    old "A collar made by a farmer dog who specialises in growing plants and boners, wearing the collar renders the wearer property of the farmer."
    new "一条由擅长种植植物和培育肉棒的农夫犬制成的项圈，戴上它便会成为农夫的所有物。"

    old "A colourful flowering plant that the lizard folks sometimes pick up for decoration, or as an ingredient for sweet tea."
    new "一种色彩鲜艳的开花植物，蜥蜴族有时会采来装饰，或用作甜茶的原料。"

    old "A combination of high quality fabrics with natural fibers that are enchanted together, meticulously woven into a soft fabric with resilience, smooth texture, and resistance to humidity. Its strings are often used in different instruments."
    new "一种由高品质织物与天然纤维组合而成、经魔法融合的材料，经过精心编织后质地柔软，富有韧性，触感顺滑且防潮。它的丝线常被用于制作各种乐器。"

    old "A dangerous adventure, between the wheat field, {p}two rows of teeth lies beneath the ground."
    new "一场危险的冒险：在麦田之间，{p}两排牙齿潜伏于地下。"

    old "A fairly rare vegetation grown in the summery farmland. It closes any non-lethal wounds and gives consumer a swift pick-me-up, according to the farmer."
    new "一种在炎热农田中生长的相当稀有的植物。据农夫所说，它能愈合所有非致命伤口，并让食用者迅速恢复精神。"

    old "A fine-threaded chaperon with a long draping liripipe that wraps around the wearer's face. Its woven magic steadies the mind and shields the wearer with a faint ward."
    new "一顶用细线织成的兜帽，长长的垂带缠绕在佩戴者脸上。织入其中的魔法能稳定心神，并以微弱的护盾庇护佩戴者。"

    old "A flirtatious outfit created by a renowned magician, the stretchy, skin-tight material clings to the wearer's body perfectly."
    new "一套由知名魔法师制作的撩人服装，富有弹性的紧身材料完美贴合穿戴者的身体。"

    old "A flower that derives its popularity among the bears from its sweetness and fruitiness. It is a great ingredients for tea, beers and ales."
    new "一种花朵，凭借甜美多汁的果实而深受熊族喜爱。它非常适合用来制作茶、啤酒和麦芽酒。"

    old "A flower with red petal that sometimes symbolise romance."
    new "一朵花瓣呈红色的花，有时象征着浪漫。"

    old "A fortress hidden by vines and guarded by ruthless thieves. A treacherous maze of traps and dangers awaits those who dare to enter, but for those who do, the promise of wealth and lawless freedom beckons."
    new "一座被藤蔓遮掩、由冷酷盗贼守卫的堡垒。险恶的陷阱与危险迷宫正等待着胆敢闯入者；但对成功进入的人来说，财富与不受法律约束的自由正在召唤。"

    old "A gem that has magical energy embedded within the gem. Discovered at the unfathomable depth of the world, its potential can only be harnessed through experienced hands."
    new "一颗蕴含魔法能量的宝石。它在世界深不可测的深处被发现，只有经验丰富的人才能驾驭其中的潜力。"

    old "A gnoll-headed flute that doesn't work anymore, but the occasional yipping amongst the stinging noise seem to resemble a ruttish gnoll's call. Touching it feels oddly nostalgic..."
    new "一支豺狼人头部造型的长笛，已经无法吹响，但刺耳的噪声中偶尔传出的吱叫，似乎很像发情豺狼人的叫声。触摸它时，会产生一种奇异的怀旧感……"

    old "A golden berry I collected from the forest area, it reduces 5 Lust."
    new "我从森林地区采集的金色浆果，可降低5点淫欲。"

    old "A golden berry collected from the forest area, it reduces 5 Lust."
    new "采自森林地区的金色浆果，可降低5点淫欲。"

    old "A grass-like plant around the wetland or lagoon. It can be made into fabric products after processing."
    new "湿地或泻湖附近的一种草本植物。加工后可以制成纺织品。"

    old "A hat left by a Hunter in the forest, with a few feathers on the side as a sign of bravery."
    new "猎人遗留在森林中的帽子，侧面插着几根羽毛，象征着勇气。"

    old "A helmet of a renowned knight in the town, framed with pure iron as a sign of honor."
    new "镇上一位声名显赫的骑士的头盔，以纯铁包边，象征着荣誉。"

    old "A herb from the alchemist's hut that can be used for spellmaking, or as sedative. Because of its strong aroma, it also sometimes acts as deterrent."
    new "炼金术士小屋里的一种草药，可用于制作法术或作为镇静剂。由于气味浓烈，有时也能起到驱避作用。"

    old "A huge crystal embedded on a slime that allows it to mimick the movement of a person."
    new "嵌在史莱姆体内的一块巨大水晶，能让它模仿人类的动作。"

    old "A kind of herb from the alchemist's hut with a lot of uses. It can be spun into textiles and ropes, or made into tisanes or herbal tea."
    new "炼金术士小屋里的一种用途广泛的草药。它可以纺成纺织品和绳索，也可以制成浸泡饮或药草茶。"

    old "A kind of rock composed of clay found under the cave, could be used for writings, or building materials."
    new "洞穴底下发现的一种黏土岩石，可用于书写或制作建筑材料。"

    old "A kind of stone most often recognised as its patches of shiny blue around the stone, which is believed to be caused by a certain curse cast upon nearby, amongst some local tribes."
    new "一种石头，通常因表面遍布闪亮的蓝色斑块而容易辨认。当地一些部族认为，这些斑块是附近遭受某种诅咒所致。"

    old "A kirtle fitted with subtle enchantment, steadying the wearer while lending a bit of flourish."
    new "一件附有微妙魔法的短袍，能让穿戴者保持稳定，同时增添几分华饰。"

    old "A knight's Cuisses customized by the town's oldest blacksmith, it happens to fit you perfectly."
    new "镇上最年长的铁匠为骑士定制的腿甲，没想到与你的身材完全合适。"

    old "A large and heavy sword designed for powerful strikes, but comes at a cost of one's mobility"
    new "一把为强力劈砍而设计的大型重剑，但会牺牲使用者的机动性。"

    old "A large harp consisted of high quality wood and strings, it produces a delicate and softer sound that it sometimes can be confused with the voice of a deity."
    new "一架由优质木材和琴弦制成的大竖琴，奏出的声音细腻柔和，有时甚至会被误认为是神明的声音。"

    old "A leather hood made from rough stitches, it is the plain bandit's most symbolic headgear, both to obfuscate their identity, and to recognise amongst themselves."
    new "一顶用粗劣针脚缝制的皮兜帽，是普通盗贼最具象征性的头饰，既能遮掩身份，也方便他们彼此辨认。"

    old "A letter sealed inside an envelope. It's not known what is inside them."
    new "一封封在信封里的信。没人知道里面装着什么。"

    old "A light woven cloth made from plant fibres. It is comfortable to wear and especially suited for simple garments and underlayers."
    new "用植物纤维制成的轻薄织物。穿起来很舒适，尤其适合制作简单的衣物和贴身内层。"

    old "A loincloth from the Tribe Puro."
    new "普罗部落的缠腰布。"

    old "A longsword of a knight used to strike down any enemy in the battle."
    new "骑士使用的长剑，用于在战场上击倒任何敌人。"

    old "A lost Battle Axe of the primordial god Ookko, the axe is once wielded in endless battles, the blade has long became blunt and chipped, but the power within is still intact."
    new "远古神祇奥科科遗失的战斧。这把斧头曾在无尽的战斗中被挥舞，如今斧刃早已变钝并布满缺口，但其中蕴含的力量依然完好。"

    old "A magical expanse of hills and flowers, serves as a hub for travelers and creatures alike, it is a place where stories and secrets are whispered on the wind."
    new "一片充满魔力的山花原野，是旅人和各种生物汇聚的中枢；故事与秘密在风中低语。"

    old "A magical metal machine that can be used to override the target with certain states."
    new "一台魔法金属机器，可以强行让目标进入特定状态。"

    old "A major cereal grain from the farmland, most cultivated for beer brewing or food."
    new "农田里的一种主要谷物，大多用于酿造啤酒或制作食物。"

    old "A massive claw jerks toward your wrist."
    new "一只巨大的爪子猛地朝你的手腕抓来。"

    old "A moonstone-threaded chaperon with a long draping liripipe and a softly glowing clasp. Its woven magic steadies the mind and shields the wearer with a faint ward."
    new "一顶用月光石丝线织成的帽兜，带有长长垂下的帽尾和柔光闪烁的扣饰。其编织魔力能稳定心神，并以微弱的结界保护佩戴者。"

    old "A mysterious potion recipe that would temporarily increase the size and strength of the drinker."
    new "一份神秘的药剂配方，能暂时提升饮用者的体型与力量。"

    old "A normal looking stone picked up from the green forest."
    new "一块从翠绿森林中捡到的、看起来很普通的石头。"

    old "A pair of old gloves from a herbalist in the dark forest, it can probably still be used to collect some dangerous herbs with ease."
    new "一双来自黑暗森林中草药师的旧手套，应该还能轻松采集一些危险的草药。"

    old "A pair of sturdy linen braies lined for warmth. They offer light protection without getting in the way of travel."
    new "一条结实的亚麻衬裤，内衬保暖。它能提供轻度防护，又不会妨碍旅途。"

    old "A patch given by the practice dummy, it seems to have covered up several garments before."
    new "练习假人给的补丁，似乎以前已经用来遮补过好几件衣物。"

    old "A peaceful forest where berries are often collected by adventurers. {p} However, the grass floor is infested with slime monster where escaping would be the first option."
    new "一片宁静的森林，冒险者常来此采集浆果。{p}然而，草地上到处都是黏液怪，遇到它们时，逃跑应该是第一选择。"

    old "A piece of bread. Nothing much."
    new "一块面包。没什么特别的。"

    old "A piece of cloth tied around the head of the wearer, usually promises good luck."
    new "一块系在佩戴者头上的布，通常寓意着好运。"

    old "A piece of mineral mined from the coldest depth, it is utilized as the burning source for forges and furnaces."
    new "一块从最寒冷的深处开采出的矿石，可作为锻炉和熔炉的燃料。"

    old "A piece of ore that seems to attract other metals, it was first used by wayfarers and travellers to navigate the land."
    new "一块似乎能吸引其他金属的矿石，最初被旅人用来辨认方向。"

    old "A piece of rhizome buried deep under the garden of the alchemist, it is used as folk medicine to treat all kinds of sickness"
    new "一段埋藏在炼金术士花园深处的根茎，被民间用药治疗各种疾病。"

    old "A plain tunic, comfortable to wear but too limpy to provide much protection."
    new "一件朴素的束腰外衣，穿起来很舒服，但太过单薄，无法提供多少保护。"

    old "A plant nearby the lagoon, its fibre can be made into linen, a kind of fabric most suitable for clothing."
    new "湖边的一种植物，其纤维可以制成亚麻布，是非常适合制作衣物的材料。"

    old "A plant with leaves that has strong scent that is said to repel canine folks, it also helps treat other user's common sicknesses."
    new "一种叶片气味浓烈的植物，据说能驱赶犬族，也有助于治疗使用者的其他常见病症。"

    old "A poisonous pile of goo full of organic substance... possibly on the outer layer of a slime."
    new "一团有毒的黏稠物，充满有机物质……可能来自黏液怪的外层。"

    old "A red fruit that looks pretty tasty, can be mistaken for a juicy plum."
    new "一种看起来相当美味的红色果实，容易被误认为是多汁的李子。"

    old "A reddish mineral from a somewhat rare ore, it was first used to make tools until iron took over."
    new "一种来自较为稀有矿脉的红色矿物，最初用于制作工具，后来被铁取代。"

    old "A roll of interlocked fibre best used in sewing and knitting."
    new "一卷交织的纤维，最适合用于缝纫和编织。"

    old "A scarf usually worn around the wearer's neck. Its smart and classy outlook probably grants wearer actual smartness as well."
    new "一条通常围在佩戴者颈间的围巾。它时髦而优雅的外观，大概也能让佩戴者真的变得聪明。"

    old "A scroll that was owned by Kari, it seems to have been soaked in some kind of liquid long ago. Touching it feels oddly nostalgic..."
    new "一卷属于卡里的卷轴，似乎很久以前曾被某种液体浸透。触摸它时，会产生一种奇异的怀旧感……"

    old "A scythe best used for harvesting barley and wheat in the field."
    new "一把最适合在田间收割大麦和小麦的镰刀。"

    old "A short sword I brought from my Tribe."
    new "一把我从部族带来的短剑。"

    old "A simplistic wooden bow, fairly lightweight and easy to handle."
    new "一把简朴的木弓，重量很轻，也很容易操控。"

    old "A skull necklace from the Tribe Puro."
    new "普罗部落的骷髅项链。"

    old "A slime ball that drops from slime."
    new "史莱姆身上掉落的史莱姆球。"

    old "A slime crystal, it is the core of the slime."
    new "史莱姆水晶，是史莱姆的核心。"

    old "A slimy bone, probably from those who are unlucky enough to get stuck in the slime."
    new "一根沾满黏液的骨头，可能来自那些不幸陷入史莱姆中的人。"

    old "A small amulet that improves rapports with merchants, making it easier to negotiate better prices."
    new "能改善与商人关系的小护符，让谈到更优惠的价格变得容易。"

    old "A small axe used for chopping woods, and probably fighting."
    new "用于砍木头的小斧头，或许也能用来战斗。"

    old "A small container made of wooden bark and paper, it looks quite durable for its own lightness."
    new "一个用树皮和纸制成的小容器，尽管轻巧，看起来却相当坚固。"

    old "A small crystal embedded within an intricate structure of metal tube, the vibration of this device can soften and adjust all sounds coming from within the tube."
    new "一枚嵌在复杂金属管结构中的小水晶，这件装置的振动能柔化并调节管内传出的各种声音。"

    old "A small pamphlet advertising a magic show near the plains, performed by the magician Ribba."
    new "一张宣传平原附近魔术表演的小传单，表演者是魔术师里巴。"

    old "A small piece of stone with some kind of engraving on it. It looks like if completed, it'll form a complete picture."
    new "一小块刻有某种图案的石头。看起来如果拼完整，就会形成一幅完整的图画。"

    old "A small, compact wooden box with a hole at the front, and leather straps installed to secure something inside tightly."
    new "一个小巧紧凑的木箱，前方有个孔洞，并装有皮带，能将里面的东西牢牢固定。"

    old "A smaller red berry that's more rock-like. It's commonly eaten with bread and it's said to strengthen the user."
    new "一种更小、更像石头的红色浆果。通常和面包一起食用，据说能增强食用者的力量。"

    old "A specialty bow carved by a hunter, best used for swift movement and aim."
    new "猎人亲手雕制的特制弓，最适合快速移动和瞄准。"

    old "A stranger in the plains lost his Lute to a group of bandits, Pirkka asks me to retrieve his favourite prose for him."
    new "平原上的一名陌生人被一伙强盗夺走了他的鲁特琴，皮尔卡让我替他取回最喜欢的文稿。"

    old "A stylish headwear, popularised by the academics of the capital."
    new "一种时髦的头饰，由首都的学者们推广开来。"

    old "A stylistic green hat of a renowned bard, decorated with two feathers from a legendary creature roaming on the plains."
    new "一顶著名吟游诗人的别致绿色帽子，上面装饰着两根来自平原上游荡的传奇生物的羽毛。"

    old "A sudden gust of wind rattles your head..."
    new "一阵突如其来的狂风吹得你的脑袋一阵晃动……"

    old "A swamp nearby the forest where its water is of a bright blue colour. {p} The magical essence within the pond grants travellers temporary vitality."
    new "森林附近的一片沼泽，水色明亮湛蓝。{p}池塘中的魔法精华能赋予旅人暂时的活力。"

    old "A tall and thin leather strips, grouped together by a frisky hand, it's one of the components of many leather-made items."
    new "一束又长又细的皮条，由灵巧的双手扎在一起，是许多皮制品的组成材料之一。"

    old "A tergid gut string covered in crystals that often enhances the magical capacity of the product, its vibration sometimes produces a harmonic effect to the listener."
    new "一根覆有水晶的坚韧肠线，常能增强制品的魔力容量；它的振动有时会为听者产生和谐的音效。"

    old "A type of common herb located near the river, most used for savory cuisine."
    new "一种生长在河边的普通香草，主要用于烹制咸味菜肴。"

    old "A type of flower that is recently used to make beer, adding a bitter flavour, it is said to have sedative effect on the consumer."
    new "一种最近被用于酿造啤酒的花，能增添苦味，据说食用后会产生镇静效果。"

    old "A type of hard fur dropped from the bears in Otsovaara. Its unique density and thickness helps protect the ursines from extreme coldness, even without clothes on."
    new "奥茨瓦拉的熊身上脱落的一种坚硬皮毛。其独特的密度和厚度能帮助熊类抵御极端寒冷，即使不穿衣服也一样。"

    old "A type of herb found around the snow region, it can be used in various beverages, but consuming it directly is said to make one feel they've experienced the eternal winter."
    new "一种生长在雪域附近的香草，可用于调制各种饮品，但据说直接食用会让人感觉自己经历了永恒的冬天。"

    old "A type of herb that is usually added to the gruit to enhance the flavour of the beer, although it is used to protect travellers from fatigue, some also reported having odd dreams after consumption."
    new "一种通常加入格鲁特啤酒中、用于增强啤酒风味的香草。虽然它也被用来帮助旅人抵抗疲劳，但有些人报告说食用后会做奇怪的梦。"

    old "A variety of flowers tidily arranged inside a decorative wrapping. There is a small card with a message attached to it."
    new "各种花朵整齐地装在精美的包装里，旁边附着一张写有留言的小卡片。"

    old "A vast snowland that stretches beyond the horizon, it is said that the retreat is the home of the celestial beast Jotunn, who wanders over the ancient observatory."
    new "一望无际的雪原延伸至地平线之外，据说这片隐居之地是天界巨兽约顿的家园，它在古老的天文台上徘徊。"

    old "A vine that is sometimes used as a climbing tool, it is most commonly seen in taller trees near the jungle region, their rapid growth speed and abundance may call for a careful extermination in the region once in a while"
    new "这种藤蔓有时会被用作攀爬工具，最常见于丛林地区较高的树木上。它生长迅速且数量众多，因此当地偶尔需要谨慎地进行清除。"

    old "A wearable portal infused with mysterious magic that may teleport something to another portal."
    new "注入神秘魔力的可佩戴传送门，可以将物品传送到另一个传送门。"

    old "A werewolf whistle that turns the sound of one's whistle into a sound resembling howling of a werewolf. It was used in a now discontinued ceremony in the werewolf pack."
    new "能将吹口哨的声音变成类似狼人嚎叫声的狼人哨子。它曾被用于狼人族群一项如今已废止的仪式。"

    old "A winding, exposed mountain road carved into the ridge that looks like a bear claw, it extends into the main road of Bear Tribe."
    new "一条蜿蜒暴露的山路，沿着形似熊爪的山脊凿出，通向熊族的主干道。"

    old "A wooden staff with a blue crystal on the top, can be used to slap your enemy, and restore 5 mana each round."
    new "顶部嵌有蓝色水晶的木杖，可以用来拍打敌人，并在每回合恢复5点法力。"

    old "A yellowish and versatile stone hewn from ancient quarries. The lime is known as a cornerstone of architectural marvels, amplifying the arcane energy woven within the building blocks."
    new "一种从古老采石场开采出的淡黄色多用途石材。石灰石被誉为建筑奇迹的基石，能够增强建筑材料中交织的奥术能量。"

    old "A... kind of hide from a wolf, possibly werewolf. You hope it doesn't come directly from one of them."
    new "一块……某种狼皮，也可能是狼人皮。希望它不是直接取自某个狼人。"

